fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4eaa75d407b9205eb3081064715f151f, https://si.imgix.net/d4676d23/uploads/origins/270ec635-3853-4ae2-be72-667dc939f314?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91927f527606522969590a4db7aec25b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d4676d23/uploads/origins/270ec635-3853-4ae2-be72-667dc939f314?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aa23696e0040fcd157703b70d4764426 3x"}, "body": "Good day.\n\nI would like to request art for a Vtuber I follow in your art style.\nHer name is Collie Woolchaser\n\nCHARACTER DETAILS\n- Is a Border Collie girl (dog girl)\n- Gyaru style outfit\n- 5'4 Height \n- likes: conventions, spicy foods, Tea and biscuits, western comics\n- Loves: tennis balls to play fetch with.\n- Mascot of \"VExpo\" A UK Convention for vtubers\n\n\nthis will be used to show fan art and on X/Twitter\n\nI hope you will consider my request!\nThank you\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yyPJWKgsCET_zRwod8TKbgC6C8XKTzEh?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yano3x/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3398599, "client_id": 1759959, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7bebf4a/uploads/origins/f5107727-1e54-4bc5-bdfa-defd8805bdc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=306677e58a73278568069966f87f14a5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7bebf4a/uploads/origins/f5107727-1e54-4bc5-bdfa-defd8805bdc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=306677e58a73278568069966f87f14a5, https://si.imgix.net/d7bebf4a/uploads/origins/f5107727-1e54-4bc5-bdfa-defd8805bdc1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7aa3cad63717b301f6101852c5c10e6 2x, h